---
description: Universal zero-slop, token-frugal rules for the Sovereign Monorepo
globs: **/*
alwaysApply: true
---

See `AGENTS.md` at repository root for full topology, port map, data plane boundaries (PocketBase `:8091` vs Legend Rust SurrealDB `:8092`), and the mandatory 5-stage `bun run gate`.

Key invariants:
1. Zero `// TODO`, `// FIXME`, `Math.random()`, mock arrays, or placeholder handlers.
2. Read targeted line ranges; never dump full large files into context.
3. Keep `LEGEND_SERVICE_TOKEN`, `LEGEND_ADMIN_TOKEN`, and `ARSY_SERVICE_TOKEN` server-side only.
4. Run `bun run gate` before every commit.
